{title: 512 - Just When I Need Him Most}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #512 • GABRIEL • 9.9.9.6.6.6.9.6}
{lyricist: William Poole}
{composer: Charles H. Gabriel}
{key: Db}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 512}
{meta: tune GABRIEL}
{meta: meter 9.9.9.6.6.6.9.6}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[Fm]Just when I need Him, Jesus [Ab]is near,
[Ab7]Just when I [Bbm]falter, [Db]just [Ab]when [Ab7]I fear;
[Ab7]Ready to help me, ready [Fm]to cheer,
[Ab]Just when I [Db/Ab]need [Ab7/Gb]Him [Db/F]most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Just [Db]when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Jesus [Db]is [Gm]near to [Ab]comfort and [Gb]cheer,
[Db/Ab]Just when I need Him most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[Fm]Just when I need Him, Jesus [Ab]is true,
[Ab7]Never forsaking, [Db]all [Ab]the [Ab7]way through,
[Ab7]Giving for burdens pleasures [Fm]anew,
[Ab]Just when I [Db/Ab]need [Ab7/Gb]Him [Db/F]most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Just [Db]when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Jesus [Db]is [Gm]near to [Ab]comfort and [Gb]cheer,
[Db/Ab]Just when I need Him most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[Fm]Just when I need Him, Jesus [Ab]is strong,
[Ab7]Bearing my [Bbm]burdens [Db]all [Ab]the [Ab7]day long;
[Ab7]For all my sorrow giving [Fm]a song,
[Ab]Just when I [Db/Ab]need [Ab7/Gb]Him [Db/F]most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Just [Db]when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Jesus [Db]is [Gm]near to [Ab]comfort and [Gb]cheer,
[Db/Ab]Just when I need Him most.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 4}
[Fm]Just when I need Him, He is [Ab]my all,
[Ab7]Answering [Bbm]when [Db]upon [Ab]Him [Ab7]I call;
[Ab7]Tenderly watching lest [Fm]I should fall,
[Ab]Just when I [Db/Ab]need [Ab7/Gb]Him [Db/F]most.
[Gb]Just when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Just [Db]when I need Him most,
[Bbm]Jesus [Db]is [Gm]near to [Ab]comfort and [Gb]cheer,
[Db/Ab]Just when I need Him most.
{end_of_verse}
